<%# ─── Accessibility Statement ──────────────────────────────────────────────── %>
<%
  const _h2 = 'text-base font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mt-8 mb-2 border-b border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 pb-2';
  const _p = 'text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-3';
  const _ul = 'list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4';
  const _link = 'text-green-700 dark:text-green-400 underline hover:no-underline';
  const _company = (typeof companyName !== 'undefined' && companyName) ? companyName : 'the company';
  const _email = typeof contactEmail !== 'undefined' ? contactEmail : null;
%>
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 shadow-lg rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
    <div class="h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-500 to-emerald-400"></div>
    <div class="p-8">

      <div class="mb-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Accessibility Statement</h1>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Last reviewed: <%= lastReviewed %></p>
      </div>

      <p class="<%= _p %>">
        This statement covers the <strong><%= _company %></strong> management platform
        (&ldquo;the Platform&rdquo;). We want everyone who uses it to be able to do their work,
        including people who use a keyboard instead of a mouse, a screen reader, screen magnification,
        voice control, or high-contrast and reduced-motion settings.
      </p>

      <h2 class="<%= _h2 %>">How accessible the Platform is</h2>
      <p class="<%= _p %>">
        We aim to meet the <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/" class="<%= _link %>">Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2</a>
        at level AA. You should be able to:
      </p>
      <ul class="<%= _ul %>">
        <li>use every page with a keyboard, with a visible focus outline, and skip past the menu with <strong>Skip to main content</strong>;</li>
        <li>use a screen as narrow as 320 pixels (the same as zooming a desktop browser to 400%) without scrolling sideways;</li>
        <li>read all text against its background in both the light and dark themes;</li>
        <li>hear form labels, required fields, errors, sort order and selected tabs with a screen reader;</li>
        <li>turn off animations by switching on &ldquo;reduce motion&rdquo; in your device settings;</li>
        <li>see each problem with a form beside the field it concerns, with a summary at the top that links to it;</li>
        <li>get a warning two minutes before you are signed out for inactivity (after 8 hours), with a button to stay signed in.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="<%= _h2 %>">Compliance status</h2>
      <p class="<%= _p %>">
        The Platform is <strong>partially compliant</strong> with WCAG 2.2 level AA, because of the
        known issues listed below.
      </p>

      <h2 class="<%= _h2 %>">Known issues</h2>
      <ul class="<%= _ul %>">
        <li>Scanned documents and PDFs that come from suppliers, HMRC and other third parties are shown as they were received. Many are images without a text layer, so a screen reader cannot read them. Ask us and we will read one to you or provide the details another way.</li>
        <li>The weekly attendance spreadsheet views are large editable grids. They work with a keyboard, but we have not yet tested them fully with screen readers.</li>
        <li>Maps (from OpenStreetMap) and charts are visual. The same information is in the tables and lists beside them.</li>
        <li>Sign-in may show a Cloudflare security check, which we do not control.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="<%= _h2 %>">Feedback and getting help</h2>
      <p class="<%= _p %>">
        If you find a part of the Platform you cannot use, or you need information in a different
        format, tell us and we will help you get the task done another way and fix the problem.
        <% if (_email) { %>
          Email <a href="mailto:<%= _email %>" class="<%= _link %>"><%= _email %></a>
          with the page address and what happened.
        <% } else { %>
          Contact your administrator with the page address and what happened.
        <% } %>
        We aim to reply within 5 working days.
      </p>

      <h2 class="<%= _h2 %>">How we test the Platform</h2>
      <p class="<%= _p %>">
        We last checked the Platform on <%= lastReviewed %>, with automated and manual checks of
        about 160 pages in both themes: keyboard use, labels and names, headings, colour contrast,
        target size, reflow at 320 pixels and page titles. Our interface guidelines include
        accessibility rules that new pages follow, and we review this statement at least once a year.
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
        <a href="/legal/privacy-policy" class="text-sm <%= _link %>">Privacy Policy</a>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/legal/cookie-policy" class="text-sm <%= _link %>">Cookie Policy</a>
        <span class="text-gray-300 dark:text-gray-600" aria-hidden="true">&bull;</span>
        <a href="/legal/terms" class="text-sm <%= _link %>">Terms of Use</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>
